      "id": "claim_d6bd099a34b94d54b2cb933077737b25",
      "statement": "In validationTasks.js, issues are grouped into tasks by the action that resolves them. Where one action fixes multiple rules on the same object, it is one task (e.g., fillWrapperSpecRows fixes both MISSING_PRODUCT_SPEC_ROW and ELEMENT_TYPE_NOT_IN_DB for wrappers). Advisory issues group by rule; recipe rules group by action.",
