      "id": "claim_aadcb2f9e02b4f70ac1be937c2150d96",
      "statement": "Three bulk-fix actions are available: fillWrapperSpecRows() adds Ideaworks/N/A spec rows for wrapper ETs, queueMissingDbRows() stages missing DesignDB rows for export, fixBlankRowRoles() sets IsContractItem=Y on all rows without IsDesign or IsContractItem. Each mutates store state and triggers re-validation.",
