      "statement": "alignmentGaps() in specAlignment.js enforces two invariants: (1) DesignDB is the master—every ElementType in Product Spec or Recipes must exist in DesignDB, (2) recipe implies spec—every ElementType in Recipes must have a Product Spec row. A catalogue entry used in no recipe needs nothing.",
